                    {
                        "form_id": "a1d4435a-53ab-4533-82dd-8e9b407c423a",
                        "entry_id": "3c6bbc98-5a9b-3547-88a8-5f5dd9349d37",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "scried"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ddb373c9-2e20-38d1-bdf4-30191586e5a9",
                        "entry_id": "3c6bbc98-5a9b-3547-88a8-5f5dd9349d37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To magically or supernaturally look into or (as an entertainer) predict (the future), using crystal balls or other objects."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4a15115-4b54-42b1-9880-4afaca7c945e",
                                "sense_id": "ddb373c9-2e20-38d1-bdf4-30191586e5a9",
                                "text": "The fortune teller claimed she could scry [into] the future."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77cdacad-e84b-3f56-b634-dcdc384193fb",
                        "entry_id": "3c6bbc98-5a9b-3547-88a8-5f5dd9349d37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To use magical means to see or look into (something that is happening outside one's sight, e.g. inside a building or far away, or in the distant past, or future, etc)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab758a95-2653-46c9-b5b1-77533935b84c",
                                "sense_id": "77cdacad-e84b-3f56-b634-dcdc384193fb",
                                "text": "Scrying spells can simply toggle the state of hidden objects to the revealed state, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bce9edc-e60e-4136-9f33-5d3d4fadf165",
                                "sense_id": "77cdacad-e84b-3f56-b634-dcdc384193fb",
                                "text": "[…] with the loss of Mekha, the shields and wardings on the temple had weakened. That meant Alonnen could now scry inside directly, albeit with a fuzzy view and no real hope of clear sound. On hearing that, Guardian-apprentice Pelai had suggested he could send in a whole series of clever, Mendhite-style scrying nodes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9655123e-bfab-453d-adf5-cfbdfcecb796",
                                "sense_id": "77cdacad-e84b-3f56-b634-dcdc384193fb",
                                "text": "[…] to get the kid's family back, they needed a plan. “You three keep an eye out. I'm going to scry inside that house.” “You sure that's a good idea?” Naleni asked. “If he's actually a string mage, no. He might sense [it].”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3a277c1-4356-4157-9c0f-ee8aace1ae26",
                                "sense_id": "77cdacad-e84b-3f56-b634-dcdc384193fb",
                                "text": "He glanced at the silver bowl on the table near the window. She had explained its purpose, how it was used to scry what was and what might be. He feared her device more than his for what was more frightening than an uncertain future? Her gaze followed his. She squeezed his hand and looked deeply into his eyes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "81fd564c-16ad-3816-9c3d-a61f44c4932c",
                        "entry_id": "3c6bbc98-5a9b-3547-88a8-5f5dd9349d37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To descry; to see."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf9c19a2-0ebf-465d-99ba-6f48f9b958ef",
                                "sense_id": "81fd564c-16ad-3816-9c3d-a61f44c4932c",
                                "text": "[…]two ſhepheards curres, had ſcryde\nA rauenous Wolfe amongſt the ſcattered flockes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
